---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Dylan Coon" description="About me, my skills, and what I'm working on.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 relative">
    <!-- Background glow -->
    <div class="absolute -top-10 -left-20 w-72 h-72 bg-[var(--color-accent)]/6 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3 tracking-tight">About Me</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mb-6">
      Software engineer, problem solver, outdoor enthusiast.
    </p>

    <!-- Divider -->
    <div class="h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-accent)]/30 via-[var(--color-border)] to-transparent mb-12"></div>

    <div class="prose mb-14">
      <p>
        Hi! My name is Dylan Coon and I am from Erie, Pennsylvania. I'm a software engineer
        with a strong foundation in computer science and a passion for solving complex problems.
        I graduated from Penn State University with a degree in Computer Science and a minor in
        Mathematics, where I built a deep understanding of algorithms, systems, and logical
        thinking — skills I apply daily in my work and personal projects. I am proficient in
        Go, Python, C and familiar with Javascript. I have worked with GCP quite a bit as well
        as AWS on occasion. I am always eager to learn new languages and tools.
      </p>

      <p>
        I started my career as an intern at Iron Mountain — an information management company
        known for their cloud based solutions they provide to hundreds of clients globally. As
        an intern, I worked on a ML team that specialized in model optimization and refactoring
        for intelligent document processing. I wrote Python code to extract signatures from
        documents and structure training data in a concurrent manner using a threading library.
        Currently, I'm a software engineer at the company, where I work on an application
        support team. I spend most of my time leveraging my Python skills to automate workflows,
        gather metrics, and monitor cloud environments. I also help validate new releases in
        production. I enjoy working with data, writing clean APIs, and diving into technical
        challenges. My main interests lie in backend development and machine learning.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside of work, I love diving into personal programming projects: I've built a CHIP-8
        emulator in C++, an in-memory key-value store in Go, and a real-time collaborative
        editing app with React and WebSockets. These side projects let me explore areas like
        low-level systems programming and database internals that I find endlessly interesting.
      </p>

      <p>
        When I'm away from a screen, I like to be outside and spend time with my dog Yankee.
        I am also an avid rock climber — I love the mental and physical puzzle that each climb
        presents. It's a great complement to my love of problem-solving in software.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-5">Skills</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="glow-card rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-accent-light)] mb-1.5">Languages</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Python, C++, Go, C</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glow-card rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-accent-light)] mb-1.5">Cloud</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">GCP, AWS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glow-card rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-accent-light)] mb-1.5">Interests</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Backend development, machine learning, SRE, data engineering</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glow-card rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-accent-light)] mb-1.5">Education</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Penn State University — B.S. Computer Science, Minor in Mathematics</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">This Site</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Built with <a href="https://astro.build" class="text-[var(--color-accent-light)] hover:underline">Astro</a> and
        <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" class="text-[var(--color-accent-light)] hover:underline">Tailwind CSS</a>.
        Deployed on Cloudflare Pages. Content authored in Markdown.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-3">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/DylanCoon99"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="github-btn"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/>
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
      <a
        href="mailto:dylcoon99@gmail.com"
        class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border border-[var(--color-border)] text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:border-[var(--color-accent)]/40 hover:text-[var(--color-text)] hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_var(--color-accent-glow)] transition-all"
      >
        Email
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
BaseLayout>
